<%- include('header') %><section class="narrow prose"><p class="eyebrow">PROMPTHUB · CREATOR VERSION</p><% if(privacy) { %><h1>Privacy in this preview.</h1><p>Creator sign-in is handled by ChatGPT. PromptHub stores your site-specific user ID, display name, handle and prompts so you can manage your page.</p><p>Published prompts, your display name and handle are visible to anyone who can access the site. Drafts are restricted to your account. Do not publish private information in a prompt.</p><p>On a published prompt page, PromptHub uses a first-party cookie with a random identifier to count one pseudonymous visitor per creator per day. The raw visitor identifier stays in the browser; only its one-way hash is stored and is deleted after 90 days. The permanent daily and monthly aggregate totals are retained for creator visitor history and payout records.</p><p>This preview does not run advertising scripts, collect payment details or calculate payable earnings. The hosting and sign-in providers may process request logs and authentication data.</p><p>Before a public launch, the operator must add a contact and deletion-request process, retention terms and any required advertising consent.</p><% } else { %><h1>A simple home for your prompts.</h1><p>PromptHub connects a creator’s reel to the prompt behind it. Creators publish a keyword and prompt; viewers open the creator’s bio link, search and copy.</p><p>This version supports creator pages, drafts, publishing, CSV imports, permanent visitor history, automatic next-month monetization eligibility, and an admin-approved manual UPI ledger. Ads and payment-gateway transfers are not enabled.</p><% } %></section><%- include('footer') %>
